<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillard said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillard said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Mike Exstein initiated coverage of Dillard Department Stores Inc with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 32-1/8 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
